READING: once W = lcm(2..X) clears ~1.67M (X>=17), the small-q census FAILS
(q -> infinity, HYP-4040) but the far-peel closes it (peel_ok=True).
The two-sided architecture: census for bounded W, far-peel for W > threshold.
